'''Keteerians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that inhabited [[the galaxy]]. [[Teroj Kee]], an ally of the [[First Order]], was a Keteerian, as was [[Terrib Igmusk]], a [[hotel]] employee at [[Canto Bight]].<ref name="Bucket's List" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
Keteerians first appeared in the [[2017]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'']]. They were first identified in the [[StarWars.com]] episode guide for "[[Dangerous Business]]," a [[2019]] episode of the television series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]''.<ref name="Bucket's List" />

